khandak ko yaad rakhna, khaibar ko yaad rakhna<br>
zehra ka darr jalaya, us darr ko yaad rakhna<br>
nauke sina pe jo tha, us sarr ko yaad rakhna<br>
har matami hai kehta, lena hai aaj badla<br>
mushkil kusha hamara, bolega ye zamana<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
