<br>
1. Jo dushmane ali hai maut apni wo marenge<br>
ghar ko jalane wale ab umr bhar jalenge<br>
ye daeshi yazidi hargiz na bach sakenge<br>
rehbar se darne wale Mehdi se kya ladenge<br>
ek aisi jung hogi maujega ye zamana<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
2. Hai intezare Mehdi taqwe se aur khirad se<br>
imdaad mil rahi hai allah-us-samad se<br>
Mehdi ki jang hogi haide hi ki rasad se<br>
duniya ko fatha karna hai ya ali madad se<br>
khaiber kusha hamara, mushkil kusha hamara<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
3. Farzande fataima hai ye warise nabi hai<br>
Abid hai ye hai Baqir ye hai Raza Taqi hai<br>
Jafar hai ye hai Kazim, ye Askari Naqi hai<br>
Hasnain e waqt ye hai, ye waqt ka Ali hai<br>
ghaibat mein aaj bhi hai zinda ali ka beta<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
4. Farshe azaa ke bache hai mimbaro ke paale<br>
rozo ke ye mujahid qur'aan ke hawale<br>
ye mujtahid, ye alim ummat ko hai sambhale<br>
ye matami mujahid ye hai namaz wale<br>
kirdaar baat-ta hai maula ali ka shia<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
5. Ye kaun tha ke jisne Zehra pe darr giraya<br>
siddiqa e jaha'n ko darbaar mein bulaya<br>
Zehra ne zakhm khake kuch bhi nahi bataya<br>
aur tooti pasliyo ko maula se bhi chupaya<br>
aye zulfiqar e haider le inteqam e Zehra<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
6. Maula ali ye dekhe karbobala ka manzar<br>
shabbir gir chuke hai teero ki sar zamee' par<br>
teero tabar bohot hai inse zyaada patthar<br>
sukha gala hai kat-ta hai qund kitna khanjar<br>
karle qubool maula in rehmato ka pursa<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
7. Chadar nahi hai sar par ye shaam ka safar hai<br>
bhai bhi hamsafar hai nauke sina pe sar hai<br>
hai darmiya'n mein zainab majma idhar udhar hai<br>
aao madad ko baba ab saatwa(7) ye darr hai<br>
zainab ne har qadam ko hai aapko pukara<br>
ali ali maula maula ali ali maula..(2)<br>
<br>
8. Ye jang aakhri hai himmat ali se lenge<br>
Mehdi pe jaan denge jannat ali se lenge<br>
Zehra se hum shahadat izzat ali se lenge<br>
ye nasiran e Mehdi taqat ali se lenge<br>
ye hai qamar ka nauha, safdar ka hai ye naara<br>
